    "body": "Bumps [astral-sh/setup-uv](https://github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv) from 8.3.2 to 10.3.0.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/releases\">astral-sh/setup-uv's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v10.3.0 🌈 Add Python architecture selection</h2>\n<h2>Changes</h2>\n<p>This release adds the <code>python-arch</code> input to select a Python architecture independently of the Python version. With <code>uv</code> 0.13.0 or later, set <code>python-arch: x86_64</code> to use x64 Python on Windows ARM64 runners.</p>\n<p>It also includes embedded checksums for <code>uv</code> releases through 0.13.0.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Use macOS 15 runners for tests <a href=\"https://github.com/charliermarsh\"><code>@​charliermarsh</code></a> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1081\">#1081</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🚀 Enhancements</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Add <code>python-arch</code> support <a href=\"https://github.com/zanieb\"><code>@​zanieb</code></a> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1079\">#1079</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🧰 Maintenance</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>chore: update known checksums for 0.13.0 @<a href=\"https://github.com/apps/github-actions\">github-actions[bot]</a> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1089\">#1089</a>)</li>\n<li>chore: update known checksums for 0.12.24 @<a href=\"https://github.com/apps/github-actions\">github-actions[bot]</a> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1084\">#1084</a>)</li>\n<li>chore: update known checksums for 0.12.23 @<a href=\"https://github.com/apps/github-actions\">github-actions[bot]</a> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1082\">#1082</a>)</li>\n<li>chore: update known checksums for 0.12.22 @<a href=\"https://github.com/apps/github-actions\">github-actions[bot]</a> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1080\">#1080</a>)</li>\n<li>chore: update known checksums for 0.12.21 @<a href=\"https://github.com/apps/github-actions\">github-actions[bot]</a> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1078\">#1078</a>)</li>\n<li>chore: update known checksums for 0.12.20 @<a href=\"https://github.com/apps/github-actions\">github-actions[bot]</a> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1076\">#1076</a>)</li>\n<li>chore: update known checksums for 0.12.19 @<a href=\"https://github.com/apps/github-actions\">github-actions[bot]</a> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1068\">#1068</a>)</li>\n<li>chore: update known checksums for 0.12.18 @<a href=\"https://github.com/apps/github-actions\">github-actions[bot]</a> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1065\">#1065</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>⬆️ Dependency updates</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>chore(deps): bump zizmorcore/zizmor-action from 0.6.2 to 0.6.3 @<a href=\"https://github.com/apps/dependabot\">dependabot[bot]</a> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1077\">#1077</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v10.2.0 🌈 Disable automatic cache saves for merge queues</h2>\n<h2>Changes</h2>\n<p>This release contains the known-checksum of the most recent uv releases and also disabled the uploading(saving) of the cache when in a merge queue since theses caches would almost never be used.</p>\n<h2>🚀 Enhancements</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Disable automatic cache saves for merge queues <a href=\"https://github.com/eifinger\"><code>@​eifinger</code></a> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1056\">#1056</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🧰 Maintenance</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>chore: update known checksums for 0.12.17 @<a href=\"https://github.com/apps/github-actions\">github-actions[bot]</a> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1058\">#1058</a>)</li>\n<li>chore: update known checksums for 0.12.16 @<a href=\"https://github.com/apps/github-actions\">github-actions[bot]</a> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1057\">#1057</a>)</li>\n<li>chore: update known checksums for 0.12.15 @<a href=\"https://github.com/apps/github-actions\">github-actions[bot]</a> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1054\">#1054</a>)</li>\n<li>chore: update known checksums for 0.12.14 @<a href=\"https://github.com/apps/github-actions\">github-actions[bot]</a> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1053\">#1053</a>)</li>\n<li>chore: update known checksums for 0.12.13 @<a href=\"https://github.com/apps/github-actions\">github-actions[bot]</a> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1045\">#1045</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>📚 Documentation</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>docs: update version references to v10.1.0 @<a href=\"https://github.com/apps/github-actions\">github-actions[bot]</a> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1044\">#1044</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>⬆️ Dependency updates</h2>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/commit/1c37ad07a6a961277cf70c0d37d6f313000f5884\"><code>1c37ad0</code></a> chore: update known checksums for 0.13.0 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1089\">#1089</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/commit/b3c9b5fc56ebc90760c43b1ac9552c0d1705d3ca\"><code>b3c9b5f</code></a> chore: update known checksums for 0.12.24 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1084\">#1084</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/commit/b06acff4b6a41bdd9cdac56507ead0bd7734e757\"><code>b06acff</code></a> Add <code>python-arch</code> support (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1079\">#1079</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/commit/c84232ca4fde9b022e20a930bfbbecd386b56fdf\"><code>c84232c</code></a> chore: update known checksums for 0.12.23 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1082\">#1082</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/commit/51fdd265d38a27ffcbca0da885510bc6fcc0ff55\"><code>51fdd26</code></a> Use macOS 15 runners for tests (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1081\">#1081</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/commit/a96208bed1fb5efb8da349c9bcc6cc58af9e7d74\"><code>a96208b</code></a> chore: update known checksums for 0.12.22 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1080\">#1080</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/commit/0e3884b860e20d3f4d5daa2347130beb51ccde47\"><code>0e3884b</code></a> chore: update known checksums for 0.12.21 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1078\">#1078</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/commit/bcf05803b55ef01a5ec6368521ee1b42f97bc438\"><code>bcf0580</code></a> chore: update known checksums for 0.12.20 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1076\">#1076</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/commit/b92a892142bde7280cd163c2abff341413314f9f\"><code>b92a892</code></a> chore(deps): bump zizmorcore/zizmor-action from 0.6.2 to 0.6.3 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1077\">#1077</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/commit/227a0f6bea25cde3444f52decccf4a18de6635f4\"><code>227a0f6</code></a> chore: update known checksums for 0.12.19 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1068\">#1068</a>)</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a href=\"https://github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/compare/11f9893b081a58869d3b5fccaea48c9e9e46f990...1c37ad07a6a961277cf70c0d37d6f313000f5884\">compare view</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n",
